@ Index:   Problem 7, solves rate, monthly
@ Author:  Jaco Mostert, fm Duncan Murray's problem set
@ N 10, PV -100, PMT 10, FV 1e-10, 12 periods a year. Solves I%/a.
LBL ‘P7’
  10
  STO ‘NPPER’
  0
  STO ‘I%/a’
  -100
  STO ‘PV’
  10
  STO ‘PMT’
  1.e-10
  STO ‘FV’
  12
  STO ‘PPER/a’
  STO ‘CPER/a’
  ENDP
  I/a
  END
